OL,3,GNEWSABreaking even 'achievable' in
OL,4,AAurigny's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is still feasible for Aurigny to
OL,7,Ffulfil its mandate to break even in the
OL,8,Fyears to come, according to the
OL,9,Fairline's chief commercial officer.
OL,11,FIt follows figures in the latest States
OL,12,Fof Guernsey budget showing the airline
OL,13,Fis expected to make an even larger loss
OL,14,Fthan expected this year.
OL,16,FProjections from earlier in the year
OL,17,Fsuggested a #5m loss this year, which
OL,18,Fhas risen to an estimated #9.7m with a
OL,19,Ffurther #5.7m loss in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
