OL,3,GNEWSABreaking even 'achievable' in
OL,4,AAurigny's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FAurigny's Philip Saunders said: "I
OL,7,Fthink breaking even is certainly
OL,8,Fachievable in the future, we simply
OL,9,Fhave to be aware of the challenges that
OL,10,Fare there and act in a timely manner
OL,11,Fand that is what we are doing."
